---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---
<PageLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms for using the Golden Moments website, its free games and printable activities, including permitted personal and group use."
  path="/terms/"
  crumb="Terms of use"
  updated="2026-10-25"
>
  <p>By using {SITE.domain} you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>

  <h2>Free to use</h2>
  <p>
    The games, guides and printables are free. You may play the games and print the activities as often as you like for
    personal, family and non-commercial group use, including in care homes, adult day programs, hospitals, libraries,
    faith groups and community groups.
  </p>
  <h2>What is not allowed</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Selling our printables, pictures or guides, or including them in a paid product, without written permission.</li>
    <li>Copying our pages or pictures to another website or app.</li>
    <li>Using the site to break the law, or trying to disrupt or overload it.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
  <p>
    Golden Moments is for recreation and general information. It is not medical advice, diagnosis or treatment. Please
    read our <a href="/medical-disclaimer/">health information notice</a>. Supervise activities as appropriate for the
    person, especially anything involving food, small objects, scents, heat or going outdoors.
  </p>
  <h2>No warranty</h2>
  <p>
    We work hard to keep the site accurate and working, but it is provided “as is”. We do not promise it will always be
    available, error free or suitable for a particular purpose. To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for any
    loss arising from use of the site.
  </p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms. The date at the top shows when they last changed.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.supportEmail}`}>{SITE.supportEmail}</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
